#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview of IBM Cloud accounts, users, instances, and permissions."
msgstr "Gambaran umum akun IBM Cloud, pengguna, instans, dan izin."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Cloud account structure"
msgstr "Struktur akun IBM Cloud"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"understand\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"understand\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Cloud account structure {#ibm-cloud-account-structure}"
msgstr "Struktur akun IBM Cloud {#ibm-cloud-account-structure}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before setting up IBM Quantum&reg; Platform, it is important to understand the IBM Cloud&reg; [Identity and Access Management (IAM) account](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-overview) structure.  As shown in the following high-level diagram, there is an **account** at the highest level.  There is only one account owner, who has exclusive control over billing management.\n"
msgstr "Sebelum menyiapkan IBM Quantum&reg; Platform, penting untuk memahami struktur [akun Identity and Access Management (IAM)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-overview) IBM Cloud&reg;. Seperti ditunjukkan pada diagram berikut, **akun** berada di tingkat tertinggi. Hanya ada satu pemilik akun, yang memiliki kendali eksklusif atas manajemen penagihan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A high level diagram is shown, illustrating the relationships between the account, users, instances, and access policies.](/docs/images/guides/cloud-account-structure/account-structure.svg 'Cloud account structure')\n"
msgstr "![Diagram tingkat tinggi yang menggambarkan hubungan antara akun, pengguna, instans, dan kebijakan akses.](/docs/images/guides/cloud-account-structure/account-structure.svg 'Struktur akun Cloud')\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This account contains multiple **users** and **service instances** (such as IBM Quantum Compute Service).  Each service instance exists in a specific **region** and has one **plan**, so if you want to have multiple plans available to your users, you will have multiple service instances, each associated with a different plan.\n"
msgstr "Akun ini berisi beberapa **pengguna** dan **instans layanan** (seperti IBM Quantum Compute Service). Setiap instans layanan berada di **wilayah** tertentu dan memiliki satu **paket**, jadi jika kamu ingin memiliki beberapa paket yang tersedia untuk penggunamu, kamu akan memiliki beberapa instans layanan, masing-masing terkait dengan paket yang berbeda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each user is assigned **access policies**, which grant them various levels of access to service instances.  Access policies can be grouped together as an **access group**.\n"
msgstr "Setiap pengguna diberi **kebijakan akses**, yang memberikan berbagai tingkat akses ke instans layanan. Kebijakan akses dapat dikelompokkan sebagai **grup akses**.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "By default, all users within the account can view one another. In account settings, you can turn on the option to restrict visibility, ensuring only users with permissions for the IAM service can see others. Notably, IBM Cloud doesn't support user groups or group-specific administrators.\n"
msgstr "Secara default, semua pengguna dalam akun dapat melihat satu sama lain. Di pengaturan akun, kamu dapat mengaktifkan opsi untuk membatasi visibilitas, memastikan hanya pengguna dengan izin untuk layanan IAM yang dapat melihat orang lain. Perlu dicatat, IBM Cloud tidak mendukung grup pengguna atau administrator khusus grup.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Access policies and groups {#access-policies-and-groups}"
msgstr "Kebijakan dan grup akses {#access-policies-and-groups}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As described previously, each user can be assigned one or more [access policies](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-iamusermanpol): individually, as part of an access group, or both.\n"
msgstr "Seperti yang dijelaskan sebelumnya, setiap pengguna dapat diberi satu atau lebih [kebijakan akses:](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-iamusermanpol) secara individual, sebagai bagian dari grup akses, atau keduanya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Within an access policy, you can specify permissions by selecting _platform_ and _service_ roles or creating custom roles. Platform roles define platform-level actions, such as creating or managing instances. Service roles grant access to perform actions within the service, such as invoking a \"create jobs\" API endpoint (that is, running a job).\n"
msgstr "Dalam kebijakan akses, kamu dapat menentukan izin dengan memilih peran _platform_ dan _layanan_ atau membuat peran kustom. Peran platform mendefinisikan tindakan tingkat platform, seperti membuat atau mengelola instans. Peran layanan memberikan akses untuk melakukan tindakan dalam layanan, seperti memanggil endpoint API \"buat pekerjaan\" (yaitu, menjalankan job).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"This guide describes a simplified representation of the IAM model. For full details, refer to the [IBM Cloud IAM documentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-iamoverview).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Panduan ini menggambarkan representasi yang disederhanakan dari model IAM. Untuk detail lengkap, lihat [dokumentasi IAM IBM Cloud.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-iamoverview)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![This diagram illustrates the relationships between access groups, access policies, and user permissions.](/docs/images/guides/cloud-account-structure/policies.svg 'Access policies and groups')\n"
msgstr "![Diagram ini menggambarkan hubungan antara grup akses, kebijakan akses, dan izin pengguna.](/docs/images/guides/cloud-account-structure/policies.svg 'Kebijakan dan grup akses')\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Roles {#roles}"
msgstr "Peran {#roles}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two families of roles: platform management and service access.\n"
msgstr "Ada dua kelompok peran: manajemen platform dan akses layanan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Platform management** roles define allowable actions, such as assigning user access and creating service instances for managing resources at the platform level. Platform roles also apply to actions that can be taken within the context of account management services, such as inviting and removing users, managing access groups, and managing service IDs.\n"
msgstr "Peran **manajemen platform** mendefinisikan tindakan yang diperbolehkan, seperti menetapkan akses pengguna dan membuat instans layanan untuk mengelola sumber daya di tingkat platform. Peran platform juga berlaku untuk tindakan yang dapat diambil dalam konteks layanan manajemen akun, seperti mengundang dan menghapus pengguna, mengelola grup akses, dan mengelola ID layanan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Service access** roles define allowable actions, such as calling service APIs or accessing a service's dashboard. These roles are customized based on the service that is selected within the policy. In the context of these guides, the service is always Quantum Compute.\n"
msgstr "Peran **akses layanan** mendefinisikan tindakan yang diperbolehkan, seperti memanggil API layanan atau mengakses dasbor layanan. Peran-peran ini dikustomisasi berdasarkan layanan yang dipilih dalam kebijakan. Dalam konteks panduan ini, layanannya selalu Quantum Compute.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Performing actions often requires a combination of platform management and service access roles.   The `writer` service role allows you to run jobs, for example, but not list instances. To list the instance you need at least the `viewer` role for the platform. Following are some commonly used roles:\n"
msgstr "Melakukan tindakan sering memerlukan kombinasi peran manajemen platform dan akses layanan. Peran layanan `writer` memungkinkanmu menjalankan job, misalnya, tetapi tidak untuk mendaftar instans. Untuk mendaftar instans, kamu memerlukan setidaknya peran `viewer` untuk platform. Berikut adalah beberapa peran yang umum digunakan:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Creating instances requires the `manager` service access role, as well as the `viewer` platform management role on All account management services.\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Users with the `viewer` platform management role on All account management services can also view services such as billing. If you want to prevent this extra view access, use the IBM Cloud CLI to give them access to just Resource groups:\n"
msgstr ""
"Membuat instans memerlukan peran akses layanan `manager`, serta peran manajemen platform `viewer` pada Semua layanan manajemen akun.\n"
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Pengguna dengan peran manajemen platform `viewer` pada Semua layanan manajemen akun juga dapat melihat layanan seperti penagihan. Jika kamu ingin mencegah akses tampilan ekstra ini, gunakan IBM Cloud CLI untuk memberi mereka akses hanya ke grup Sumber Daya:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  </Admonition>\n"
"- Running jobs requires the `writer` service access role and `viewer` platform management role access to the instance.\n"
msgstr ""
"  </Admonition>\n"
"- Menjalankan job memerlukan peran akses layanan `writer` dan akses peran manajemen platform `viewer` ke instans.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When creating an access policy (either on an access group or for a user), you can check which actions are part of the role by reviewing the description. For example `quantum-computing.job.create - Create a job to run a program`.\n"
msgstr "Saat membuat kebijakan akses (baik pada grup akses maupun untuk pengguna), kamu dapat memeriksa tindakan mana yang merupakan bagian dari peran dengan meninjau deskripsinya. Misalnya `quantum-computing.job.create - Create a job to run a program`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also determine the actions allowed by each role from the [IAM Roles](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/roles) page.  Select Quantum Compute in the dropdown menu at the top of the page.  Then, for a more detailed list, click the number in the column next to the role name.  For example, by visiting that page and clicking the number by the Manager role, you can see that this role includes the ability to delete a job (`quantum-computing.job.delete`).\n"
msgstr "Kamu juga dapat menentukan tindakan yang diizinkan oleh setiap peran dari halaman [IAM Roles](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/roles). Pilih Quantum Compute di menu dropdown di bagian atas halaman. Kemudian, untuk daftar yang lebih rinci, klik angka di kolom di sebelah nama peran. Misalnya, dengan mengunjungi halaman tersebut dan mengklik angka di sebelah peran Manager, kamu dapat melihat bahwa peran ini mencakup kemampuan untuk menghapus job (`quantum-computing.job.delete`).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following table provides examples for some of the platform management actions that users can take within the context of IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"
msgstr "Tabel berikut memberikan contoh untuk beberapa tindakan manajemen platform yang dapat dilakukan pengguna dalam konteks IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Platform management role | Quantum Compute                                              |\n"
"|--------------------------|--------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| Viewer role              | View instances and credentials                               |\n"
"| Operator role            | View instances and manage credentials                        |\n"
"| Editor role              | Create, delete, edit, and view instances. Manage credentials |\n"
"| Administrator role       | All management actions for services                          |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Peran manajemen platform | Quantum Compute                                              |\n"
"|--------------------------|--------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| Peran Viewer             | Melihat instans dan kredensial                               |\n"
"| Peran Operator           | Melihat instans dan mengelola kredensial                     |\n"
"| Peran Editor             | Membuat, menghapus, mengedit, dan melihat instans. Mengelola kredensial |\n"
"| Peran Administrator      | Semua tindakan manajemen untuk layanan                       |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Service access role | Quantum Compute                                                      |\n"
"|---------------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| Reader              | Perform read-only actions, such as viewing jobs                      |\n"
"| Writer              | Permissions beyond the reader role, including running jobs           |\n"
"| Manager             | Permissions beyond the writer role, including provisioning instances, setting the instance cost limit, and deleting or canceling a job |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Peran akses layanan | Quantum Compute                                                      |\n"
"|---------------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| Reader              | Melakukan tindakan hanya-baca, seperti melihat job                    |\n"
"| Writer              | Izin di luar peran reader, termasuk menjalankan job                   |\n"
"| Manager             | Izin di luar peran writer, termasuk menyediakan instans, mengatur batas biaya instans, dan menghapus atau membatalkan job |\n"

